  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.6: Supersedes the unpublished alpha.5 package after fixing tagged-release provenance capture. Closed-month author-period manifests now support more than 128 selected changes, reuse large-tree evidence more efficiently, reconcile overlap in linear space, schedule two repositories concurrently, and emit privacy-safe progress and cancellation diagnostics. Development-only uncertainty, manual-QA, and total-first calibration tooling does not change shipped seed-rules/0.4.0. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.6/CHANGELOG.md",
